Description: A mysterious and atmospheric illustration of two young women in school uniforms standing in a dark rice paddy at night. One girl kneels, shining a flashlight near a bucket, while the other stands behind her, directing her flashlight forward. Above them hovers a glowing red koi fish, adding a surreal touch to the scene. The background features a body of water, distant lights on the opposite shore, and a starless night sky, creating an eerie yet captivating mood. Their uniforms include blue sailor collars, pleated skirts, and black-framed glasses, grounding the fantastical elements in a familiar school setting..
