Kasaki Nozomi: black hair in short ponytail, wearing same uniform, being embraced, Setting: near window, soft blue lighting, intimate atmosphere, [Natural Language Supplement]: This tender yuri artwork captures a romantic moment between Yoroizuka Mizore and Kasaki Nozomi from "Hibike! Euphonium" in their school uniforms. Mizore, with her long black hair flowing, gently cradles Nozomi''s face in her hands as they sit near a window bathed in soft blue light. Nozomi, her black hair tied in a short ponytail, leans into the embrace as their lips meet in a passionate french kiss. Both wear Kitauji High''s distinctive uniform - white shirts with blue sailor collars and neckerchiefs, blue pleated skirts, and white socks. The composition beautifully conveys the depth of their relationship through the intimate gesture and the warm, muted color palette that envelops the scene..
-1::ai-generated, ai-assisted, ::
