Captured from behind, Sadako''s form is a blur of desperate motion. Her body is contorted, one arm powerfully pushing against the dark wooden floor, the other reaching frantically towards the blue-glowing television. Tears stream from her cute, wide eyes as she throws a pained look back. Her long hair trails behind, emphasizing the raw effort of her crawl. Dirty soles of her bare feet show, straining against the rope binding them.
