Reze from Chainsaw Man is depicted in a medium shot, partially submerged in a body of water, likely a pool. She has wet, dark hair and striking green eyes that meet the viewer''s gaze with a subtle, closed-mouth smile. She wears a black choker around her neck. Her hands are raised out of the water, palms slightly open, as if inviting interaction. The scene is bathed in cool, bluish light, creating a serene yet somewhat mysterious atmosphere, with gentle ripples on the water''s surface.
