INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(256726,464,'best quality, amazing quality, very aesthetic, no text

An anime-style digital illustration of a young woman with short reddish-brown hair standing amidst a swirling vortex of cherry blossoms and ribbons. She wears a dark grey long-sleeved dress with a large, patterned blue bow tied around her waist, a ruffled white bonnet on her head, and a voluminous, layered white skirt that cascades downwards. Her expression is serene with downcast eyes as she stands in a slightly tilted posture. She is surrounded by dynamic, flowing blue ribbons, white paper streamers, and a chaotic vortex of thick black and grey brushstrokes resembling swirling water or wind in the bottom right foreground. A bright, glowing white sphere rests near the bottom left, casting a strong light upwards onto the ruffled fabrics. In the background, a dense canopy of pink cherry blossoms on gnarled branches fills the frame, with patches of a pale blue sky peeking through the top. The image is rendered in a painterly style with visible, textured brushstrokes and dramatic lighting that creates a strong sense of motion., very aesthetic, masterpiece, no text','社区精选 017','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789443787,'e7eb8abc-ddc7-46c1-b283-89ca9ccaf67e','4a3c6fc8-06ec-4c3f-a7a3-b3bb452fe629');
