```xml
<artwork>
  <rendering_and_art_style>
    Japanese modern anime digital illustration with clean, warm-toned line art and delicate cel-shading combined with soft airbrushed lighting. Features vibrant bloom, soft ambient diffusion, and painterly environmental blending.
  </rendering_and_art_style>

  <color_system>
    Dominant warm palette led by terracotta red (#B8523A) on the hood, warm blonde (#FBE7B5) hair, and amber gold (#ECA836) irises. Balanced by natural meadow greens (#9BB84D, #678635) and soft sun-bleached cream highlights (#FFFFE0). Shadows are tinted with subtle warm mauve and desaturated earthy tones (#6E5352).
  </color_system>

  <camera_and_composition bbox="[0, 0, 1000, 1000]">
    Close-up vertical portrait with a slightly high-angle perspective looking down at the character sitting on the grass. The composition uses a strong central focus, framed on the right by a textured tree trunk and in the foreground by soft-focus white wildflowers.
  </camera_and_composition>

  <lighting_and_atmosphere>
    Bright midday dappled sunlight filtering through tree leaves (komorebi), casting bright specular spots (#FFFFE8) across the character''s face, hair, and clothing. High-key bloom and Tyndall light scatter create a warm, cheerful, and airy outdoor atmosphere.
  </lighting_and_atmosphere>

  <character_and_anatomy bbox="[0, 50, 980, 950]">
    <identity>
      Rossi from Arknights: Endfield. Features large, erect fox-like animal ears (#FBE7B5, interior white fluff #FFFFFF) poking through openings in her hooded cloak.
    </identity>
    
    <facial_structure_and_expression bbox="[230, 230, 480, 640]">
      Youthful, rounded face with soft cheek blush (#F5A492). Large, luminous amber eyes (#ECA836) with distinct diamond-shaped pupils and bright white catchlights. Cheerful, open-mouthed smile (:D) displaying a small visible upper fang.
    </facial_structure_and_expression>

    <hair_architecture>
      Pale warm blonde hair (#FBE7B5) parted in the center, featuring soft straight bangs across the forehead and two thick locks tied into low, rounded twintails (#EBD096) resting over her shoulders, secured with simple blue bands (#5475A8).
    </hair_architecture>

    <pose_and_biomechanics>
      Sitting/kneeling forward on the grassy ground, leaning her upper body forward with straight arms extended downward, resting both hands in front of her atop a transparent utility board.
    </pose_and_biomechanics>

    <attire_and_materials>
      Wears a prominent terracotta-red (#B8523A) hooded cape with geometric zigzag hems, fitted ear holes, and small black mechanical wing-like hairpins near the base of the right ear. Features tactical dark straps (#38302E) across the chest and waist, light-colored fingerless gloves (#DCD7CE) with thick cylindrical wrist cuffs (#8A8E85), and a pale skirt (#EFECE6).
    </attire_and_materials>
  </character_and_anatomy>

  <environment_and_scenery>
    A sun-drenched grassy knoll covered in vibrant green turf (#9BB84D) and clusters of small white blooming wildflowers (#FFFFFF). The right side is anchored by a vertical tree trunk, while the background dissolves into soft, bokeh-blurred forest foliage under direct sunlight.
  </environment_and_scenery>
</artwork>
