```xml
<artwork>
  <rendering_and_art_style>
    Modern high-key anime digital illustration featuring clean, expressive linework tinted in warm reddish-brown tones. Uses soft cel-shading combined with delicate airbrushed gradients on the skin and hair, with crisp material rendering and minimal halftone textures against an isolated canvas.
  </rendering_and_art_style>

  <color_system>
    <dominant_palette>
      <color name="hair_base" hex="#FDF1CA"/>
      <color name="vest_base" hex="#9E7875"/>
      <color name="window_frame" hex="#00A887"/>
      <color name="garment_white" hex="#FBF6F0"/>
    </dominant_palette>
    <secondary_accents>
      <color name="beret_charcoal" hex="#31343E"/>
      <color name="eye_amber" hex="#EFA642"/>
      <color name="ribbon_orange" hex="#E68B43"/>
      <color name="interior_shadow" hex="#232026"/>
    </secondary_accents>
    High-key exposure balancing warm cream and blonde tones against the vivid teal frame and dark interior contrast.
  </color_system>

  <camera_and_composition bbox="[0, 0, 1000, 1000]">
    Dynamic cowboy-shot crop framed along a diagonal axis. The subject leans outward through an emerald train window frame on the left, breaking the boundary toward the viewer against a stark white background.
  </camera_and_composition>

  <lighting_and_atmosphere>
    Bright direct frontal key light (#FFF7EB) illuminating the character''s face, hair, and torso. Deep ambient occlusion and cast shadows (#2A242B) inside the train cabin accentuate the depth as she pops out into the light.
  </lighting_and_atmosphere>

  <character_and_anatomy bbox="[48, 86, 960, 972]">
    <identity>
      Rossi from Arknights: Endfield. Canine/wolf-girl traits including large, upright triangular ears with dense white inner fluff (#FFFFFF) and a large, bushy tail curling behind her.
    </identity>
    
    <facial_structure_and_expression bbox="[178, 510, 395, 720]">
      Joyful open-mouthed expression showing upper teeth and tongue (#E87A7A). Wide, luminous amber eyes (#EFA642) with starry multi-layered highlights and delicate peach blush marks (#F8A499) on her cheeks.
    </facial_structure_and_expression>

    <hair_architecture>
      Tousled medium-length pale blonde hair (#FDF1CA) with soft yellow highlights (#FFFBE8). Feathery bangs frame the forehead, while side locks are tied into small tufts with orange ribbons (#E68B43) below her prominent ears.
    </hair_architecture>

    <pose_and_biomechanics>
      Dynamic forward lean through the window aperture; torso tilted at an angle with the right arm extending downward to grip the sill, while the left arm flexes upward with relaxed fingers near the cheek.
    </pose_and_biomechanics>

    <attire_and_materials>
