```xml
<artwork>
  <rendering_and_art_style>
    Clean digital anime illustration featuring soft cel-shading combined with smooth airbrush gradients. Fine, dynamic brown-tinted line art with delicate line tapering on skin contours and hair tips. High-saturation summer color palette with glossy highlight finishes on water droplets and wet vinyl materials.
  </rendering_and_art_style>

  <color_system>
    <palette>
      <dominant_colors sky_blue="#3D9BE9" ocean_cyan="#4AB2E4" cloud_white="#FFFFFF" />
      <character_tones hair_blonde="#F3CB7A" hair_shadow="#D69A4C" skin_fair="#FFE6D6" eye_amber="#E89B2B" />
      <garment_and_props swimsuit_navy="#182A3A" ring_pink="#F4A6CA" ring_highlight="#FFFFFF" />
    </palette>
    <temperature_balance>Vibrant warm sunlight against cool atmospheric blue tones, balanced with soft peach subsurface scattering on the skin.</temperature_balance>
  </color_system>

  <camera_and_composition bbox="[0, 0, 1000, 1000]">
    Slightly low-angle three-quarters shot focusing on the character leaning forward towards the viewer. The large, fluffy tail balances the upper right quadrant while the pink swim ring anchors the lower foreground. Mid-close crop emphasizing expression and summer beach atmosphere.
  </camera_and_composition>

  <lighting_and_atmosphere>
    Bright direct overhead sunlight cast from top-right (#FFF6D5), producing sharp highlights on the character''s shoulders, wet skin droplets, and the glossy swimsuit. Soft blue environmental fill light reflected from the ocean and sky into the cast shadows, accompanied by subtle lens flare streaks near the upper clouds.
  </lighting_and_atmosphere>

  <character_and_anatomy bbox="[70, 100, 1000, 990]">
    <identity>
      Rossi from Arknights: Endfield. Canine/wolf beastfolk girl characterized by large, erect vulpine/wolf ears and an oversized, fluffy blonde-cream tail.
    </identity>
    
    <facial_structure_and_expression bbox="[170, 180, 440, 400]">
      Youthful facial features with large amber-gold irises (#E89B2B) featuring defined pupils and starry catchlights. Slender arched eyebrows, soft peach cheek blush, and a slightly open, expressive mouth showing small teeth in an energetic, candid gaze directly at the viewer.
    </facial_structure_and_expression>

    <hair_architecture>
      Warm golden-blonde hair (#F3CB7A) styled with straight bangs, braided front strands framing the face, and shoulder-length locks tied into small side bunches. Topping the head are large, erect wolf ears lined with fluffy white inner fur (#E6F0F8).
    </hair_architecture>

    <pose_and_biomechanics>
      Leaning forward in a playful contrapposto posture. Both hands rest with gentle tension on the top edge of a pink swim ring. The upper torso tilts toward the viewer, with her back arched and a massive, voluminous tail curving dynamically behind her right side.
    </pose_and_biomechanics>

    <attire_and_materials>
      Classic Japanese one-piece school swimsuit (sukumizu) in deep navy blue (#182A3A). Form-fitting synthetic stretch fabric displaying natural tension creases along the torso and waist, accented by wet water droplets scattered across the shoulders, arms, and legs.
    </attire_and_materials>
  </character_and_anatomy>

  <environment_and_scenery>
    <foreground bbox="[760, 30, 1000, 830]">
      Translucent inflatable pink swim ring (#F4A6CA) with bright specular light reflections and soft internal water refractions.
    </foreground>
    <background bbox="[0, 0, 1000, 1000]">
      Bright summer seascape featuring an azure sky (#3D9BE9), billowy white cumulus clouds, and shimmering turquoise ocean water under open sunlight.
    </background>
  </environment_and_scenery>
</artwork>
