```xml
<artwork>
  <rendering_and_art_style>
    Modern high-end anime digital illustration featuring clean line art tinted in soft warm browns (#7A5243). The shading method combines crisp cel-shaded shadow edges with subtle soft airbrushed gradients on skin and hair, rendered in a bright, sunlit aesthetic.
  </rendering_and_art_style>

  <color_system>
    A bright summer coastal palette dominated by honey blonde (#E8B67C) and creamy white (#FAF8F8) in the foreground, contrasted against clear cerulean ocean blue (#5CA4CE) and pale sky blue (#B8D8F0). Warm peach skin tones (#FCE2D4) feature soft coral blush (#EE9485), balanced by sage green (#98B391) creature accents.
  </color_system>

  <camera_and_composition bbox="[0, 0, 1000, 1000]">
    Slight high-angle shot focused closely on the character kneeling in the center foreground. The vertical framing emphasizes the kneeling posture and direct eye contact, using a low horizon line to showcase the expansive open sea in the background.
  </camera_and_composition>

  <lighting_and_atmosphere>
    Bright midday natural sunlight from the upper right, casting soft warm highlights (#FFF5E4) along the top of the hair, shoulders, and ears. Subtle diffuse bounce lighting reflects from the pale sand onto the lower limbs and torso.
  </lighting_and_atmosphere>

  <character_and_anatomy bbox="[20, 0, 955, 930]">
    <identity>
      Rossi from Arknights: Endfield. Canine/Lupo characteristics including tall pointed animal ears with dense white interior fur (#F5EFEA) and a large, thick fluffy tail (#E5B177).
    </identity>
    
    <facial_structure_and_expression bbox="[130, 400, 390, 680]">
      Heart-shaped face with a confident, open-mouthed smile. Warm amber-orange irises (#C97E3B) with dark pupils and bright white diamond/star catchlights visible through strands of hair, complemented by a soft flush across the cheeks and nose bridge.
    </facial_structure_and_expression>

    <hair_architecture>
      Short, voluminous honey-blonde hair (#E8B67C) styled into two small low pigtails tied with silver ring clips (#A4A8B0). Straight layered bangs frame the forehead with small crown braids on both sides.
    </hair_architecture>

    <pose_and_biomechanics>
      Kneeling on both knees on the beach sand, leaning forward with arms extended downward and fingertips lightly resting on the ground, creating a forward-tilted upper body posture.
    </pose_and_biomechanics>

    <attire_and_materials>
      A clean white one-piece swimsuit (#FAF8F8) featuring an off-the-shoulder elastic neckline with an accordion-ruffle band, adorned with a small red insignia badge (#D34338) on the left chest.
    </attire_and_materials>
  </character_and_anatomy>

  <environment_and_scenery>
    A sunny tropical beach midground with shallow turquoise waters and gentle white foam lapping against smooth, wet sand (#D8C2AF). A plump, stylized sage-green frog mascot (#98B391) stands partially submerged beside the character under a bright, softly clouded summer sky.
  </environment_and_scenery>
</artwork>
