                                                                                                                            ,ardashir_(arknights), 1girl, solo, short white hair, messy hair, blue eyes, pointy ears, dark headwear, pale skin, handsome girl, flat chest, boyishblack trench coat, high collar shirt, dark techwear, black pants, black fingerless gloves, silver rings, blue glowing accentsconfident smile, smirk, looking down, calm, serene, slight arrogancesitting, spread legs, resting chin on hand, holding dark wooden staff, leaning forward, commanding poseancient stone structure, vast night landscape, starry night sky, flock of glowing blue birds flying, faint celestial chart lines in backgroundrim lighting, glowing particles, deep shadows, dramatic lighting, cinematic lighting, depth of field, bloomfrom below, low angle, medium full shot, dynamic angledark theme, blue theme, black theme, cold color palettePositioned powerfully in the center of the frame, the handsome anime girl with short white hair sits confidently on an ancient stone monument. She leans forward with a captivating smirk, resting her chin on a elegantly gloved hand while gently gripping a highly detailed dark staff. The background expands into an epic and vast deep night landscape, filled with magical glowing blue birds taking flight against a breathtaking starry sky. Dramatic rim lighting casts an imposing glow from below, perfectly capturing a cinematic, mysterious, and majestic atmosphere.','社区精选 204','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789443888,'c5f3dd9d-3a10-4aa4-bb59-d5a59c1d7350','4a3c6fc8-06ec-4c3f-a7a3-b3bb452fe629');
