y
<style>
year 2025,year 2026,fine fabric emphasis,detailed background,round face, ultra-detailed,detailed background,ultra complexity
</style>

An anime digital illustration rendered with crisp clean lineart, soft cel-shading that melts into gentle airbrushed gradients, and a luminous painterly finish over a clean white backdrop. The composition is a vertical portrait framed around a single petite figure, a young feline vampire girl with the delicate childlike proportions of a loli, seated and turned toward the viewer in a relaxed, affectionate pose. Her body is angled three-quarters while her face tilts up to meet the camera at eye level, creating an intimate and engaging connection.

Her skin is fair and smooth with a soft peachy warmth, and a delicate flush of rosy pink spreads across her cheeks and the bridge of her nose. Her expression is a tender closed-lip smile that curves gently at the corners, and at the edge of that smile two tiny pointed fangs peek from between her lips, a subtle whisper of her vampire nature. Her eyes are large, round, and striking, glowing with a vibrant crimson red that holds deep starry reflections, tiny specks of light scattered across the iris like a night sky, framed by soft dark lashes and a faint highlight dot that makes them glisten. The collarbones are softly visible just beneath the loose neckline, and a gentle indentation of skin shows where her arm presses against her torso.

On top of her head sit a pair of delicate feline ears, rounded and pointed, colored in cool ice-blue and white with soft inner shading, angled as if attuned to the room. Her hair is a long flowing cascade of pale ice-blue, slightly disheveled and tousled, drifting in loose waves past her shoulders and down her back, with fine wispy bangs falling across her forehead and a few stray flyaway strands catching the light around her cheeks. The hair carries a cool almost translucent sheen with brighter silver-blue highlights along the crown.

She rests her chin on her hands, both fists loosely closed and forearms propped upright, elbows settled against her raised legs, conveying a sense of cozy anticipation. One knee is lifted high toward the foreground, the bare thigh broad and smooth with a soft specular sheen, while the other leg tucks beneath her, the white sock just visible at the ankle. Her posture is compact and youthful, the small frame balanced with easy grace.

Her outfit is a loose white short-sleeved top with deep crimson trim ringing the collar and the cuffs, the fabric draping softly with relaxed tension folds across the chest and sleeves, the hem resting over her waist. Below she wears dark navy shorts that fall high on the thigh, the matte cotton fabric gathering in gentle folds, marked on one hip with a small stylized white emblem. A black ribbon choker is tied neatly around her throat, finished with a tiny metallic bell that catches a glint of light.

Behind her, the plain white space is decorated with elegant musical motifs, a sweeping arc of golden-yellow staves with small note heads curving around her form, a bold red treble clef rising in the upper right, and a softer sky-blue treble clef floating at the lower left, all rendered as clean flat graphic shapes that frame the figure without cluttering it.

The lighting is bright and even, a soft frontal key light that keeps the shadows gentle and the skin glowing, with subtle rim highlights tracing the edges of her hair, ears, and the raised thigh. The overall mood is warm, sweet, and quietly whimsical, the decorative notes lending a musical and playful atmosphere to the portrait., very aesthetic, masterpiece, no text','社区精选 211','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789443892,'c23b3859-0a2b-4614-ab32-d38ab4733cb8','4a3c6fc8-06ec-4c3f-a7a3-b3bb452fe629');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(256832,464,'<artist>
0.7::urotsuki (ku9625)::,healthyman:year 2026,0.5::kanzarin:year 2026,::,kele mimi,0.8::takashima shoa:year 2026,::,0.7::na tarapisu153, ::artist:bacheally
</artist>

<style>
year 2025,year 2026,fine fabric emphasis,detailed background,round face, ultra-detailed,detailed background,ultra complexity
</style>

An anime digital illustration rendered with crisp clean lineart, smooth cel-shading, and softly blended color gradients, set against a seamless plain white studio background that isolates the figure in calm, neutral light. The central subject is a young girl with a delicate, slightly drowsy expression, leaning her upper body gently forward toward the viewer in a relaxed, half-lowered stance framed as a cowboy shot from the mid-thigh upward. Her gaze meets the lens through half-lidded eyes of warm luminescent yellow, the irises catching a soft pinpoint highlight, framed by long dark lashes and a faint flush of dusty rose across her cheeks and the bridge of her nose. Her small lips are parted in a quiet, almost dazed pout, and a hint of collarbone shows at the opening of her collar.

Her hair is strikingly white and extremely long, falling in smooth glossy sheets far past her waist with a cool pale-blue shadow tone in the depths and bright silvery highlights along the crest of each lock. A single thick side braid is woven over one shoulder, its rounded coils catching the light, while fine wispy strands and a few flyaways soften the silhouette around her face. A soft curtain of bangs is parted in the center with a delicate strand falling directly between her eyes, and longer side locks frame both cheeks. On the crown of her head sit two large mismatched ribbons, one in deep matte black and the other in bright tangerine orange, their stiff folded wings spreading outward. Tucked beside one bow is a small feather hair ornament composed of slender jet-black feathers fanning upward.

At the neckline, a structured stand-up collar rises neatly, anchored at the center of the chest by a small orange diamond-shaped brooch with a faceted gleam. A narrow orange neck ribbon is knotted at the throat, its two long flat ends trailing down over the bodice. Draped over the shoulders is a short black capelet edged with a crisp white frill trim, the frills catching a thin rim of light along their scalloped edge. Beneath it she wears a black dress with long, generously puffy sleeves that gather into fitted cuffs past the wrists, the fabric showing soft tension folds at the elbows and hips. The skirt is deliberately asymmetrical, with a one-sided orange overskirt sweeping across one side over an underlying white pleated layer, the sharp pleats fanning out in even geometric ridges. Along the front, criss-cross lace-up straps cross over one another in a neat X-pattern, and a black bow is tied at the waist. The hem is finished with multiple layers of frilled ruffles that part to reveal a soft grey petticoat tucked beneath. Her legs are sheathed in fine grey pantyhose, and her feet are in glossy black mary jane shoes secured with a thin ankle strap.

One arm is bent with the hand resting casually on the hip, pushing the hip out slightly, while the other arm falls loosely forward, the posture giving a slouching, endearingly tired air. The lighting is soft and even, a gentle frontal key light that models the roundness of the face and the volume of the hair, paired with a subtle cool rim glow tracing the outer edges of the white locks and the frilled capelet, all under a clean, low-contrast studio atmosphere with faint bloom and no harsh shadows., very aesthetic, masterpiece, no text','社区精选 213','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789443893,'e029c434-240a-436d-a3a8-30cf23dc66b6','4a3c6fc8-06ec-4c3f-a7a3-b3bb452fe629');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(256833,464,'close-up portrait from a slightly low angle, subject partially framed by lush green leaves in the foreground; rendered on cold-pressed watercolor paper with highly visible paper fibers and subtle pigment granulation—leaves show soft washes with gentle bleeding, faint pencil underdrawing peeking through translucent layers, and tiny graphite smudges along stem edges; dewdrops are luminous halos with soft watercolor bloom, not crisp reflections; hair strands outlined in fine brush ink with slight irregularity, mimicking hand-drawn line variation, and subtly diffused at tips like wet pigment; composition uses generous negative space around the eye, background softly blurred in aged paper beige and muted sage tones; overall aesthetic: a tactile hand-drawn studio illustration—cel-shading structure preserved beneath delicate watercolor washes, visible paper grain at macro scale, gentle imperfections (slight edge fraying, faint crease marks), evoking a cherished sketchbook page from a healing-art illustrator. 4k resolution, no digital perfection, all details emphasize physical medium authenticity., best quality, amazing quality, very aesthetic, absurdres, masterpiece, highres, newest, high detail','社区精选 214','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789443894,'28b34590-591d-467b-b0a5-84b4370a3509','4a3c6fc8-06ec-4c3f-a7a3-b3bb452fe629');
