                                                                                                                           ,masterpiece, best quality, ultra detailed,  2girls, perlica (arknights), silver hair, long flowing hair, blue eyes, zhuangfangyi (arknights), black hair, medium hair, beautiful detailed eyes, soft skin, sweatdropswhite techwear jacket, black tactical outfit, pleated skirt, thigh boots, fingerless gloves, mechanical weapon, giant chainsword, sharp teeth on sword, sci fi gearintense emotion, aggressive smile, crazy smile, angry, panicked, crying, terrified, looking back, screamingsprinting, chasing, intense running, swinging sword, holding heavy weapon, dynamic running pose, reaching out, hair flying in the windsci fi ruins, overgrown city, destroyed concrete walls, green vines, clear blue sky, bright daylight, rubble, metal debris, shattered glasscinematic lighting, motion blur, flying sparks, dust particles, lens flare, bokeh, chromatic aberration, rim lighting, dynamic shadowsdynamic angle, dutch angle, from side, low angle, wide shot, action camera, rule of thirdsblue sky theme, high contrast, vibrant green, metallic tonesAn epic and highly detailed cinematic anime illustration of Perlica from Arknights fiercely chasing Zhuangfangyi through overgrown sci-fi city ruins. Perlica is positioned on the left side of the composition, lunging forward aggressively while wielding a massive, roaring Warhammer 40K chainsword, with bright sparks flying from the spinning teeth. Zhuangfangyi is sprinting frantically towards the right side of the frame, looking back over her shoulder in absolute panic. The scene perfectly blends beautiful anime character aesthetics with intense, explosive action. There is a strong sense of speed conveyed through dynamic motion blur on the weapon and their limbs. Debris, dust, and sparks are kicked into the air around them, all beautifully illuminated by brilliant warm sunlight that creates dramatic lens flares and a cinematic depth of field.','社区精选 263','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789443928,'b36c9e05-2de5-4e19-935a-7573921f306a','4a3c6fc8-06ec-4c3f-a7a3-b3bb452fe629');
