1.3::Four girls crammed tightly together on one subway bench, with the third girl arrogantly lying sideways across most of the available seating::, 4girls,  Straight-on eye-level view from the aisle. The first girl looks down at her phone. The second girl sleeps while being compressed toward the left. The third girl lies lengthwise across the middle and right side of the bench, propping up her head with one arm; one leg stretches along the seat while her other knee is raised and its sneaker is planted directly on the seat cushion. Her body occupies several seating spaces and forces the fourth girl against the far-right edge. The fourth girl leans away from the nearby sneaker, looking away with a very awkward expression.
