The paper is a clean sheet of stamp paper lying flat on a smooth surface, viewed from directly above. A cute chibi girl with the specified appearance is printed in the center as a pink outline stamp. The stamped image consists only of thin, continuous pink contour lines, with no solid fill or shading. The character is seated facing the viewer, with a slight tilt of the head and hands resting on the knees. The linework has a subtle ink-bleed texture along the edges, slightly soaking into the paper fibers. The paper is bright white with a matte finish., pink theme, pastel colors, flat colors, soft lighting, high complexity.','社区精选 354','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789444003,'0be12a5c-d9b6-4077-9ddd-666e1ef4a893','4a3c6fc8-06ec-4c3f-a7a3-b3bb452fe629');
