                                                                                                                           ,1girl, solo,Ch''en the Dawnstreak (arknights),  (arknights), long hair, blue hair, ponytail, horns, demon horns, blue eyes, injury, blood on skinsleeveless shirt, white shirt, black jacket, open jacket, hood, strapsserious expression, focused, determined, looking to the sideholding sword, pointing sword, two handed grip, fighting stance, dynamic posesummoned red  dragon, chinese dragon, ghost dragon, ice, ice spikes, city background, night, buildingsdramatic lighting, cinematic lighting, strong rim light, glowing weapon, red glow, lens flare, bloom, high contrast, anamorphic, letterbox, film stillfrom side, medium shot, eye-levelblue theme, red theme, black themeIn a dramatic, cinematic shot, Ch''en stands firm amidst jagged ice spikes, pointing her glowing red sword, Chi''xiao, forward. Behind her, the massive, spectral form of a Chinese dragon looms against the dark city skyline, its essence echoing her determined fighting stance. Strong rim lighting carves her figure out from the darkness, highlighting her silhouette and the billowing fabric of her jacket. The intense red glow from her sword cuts through the cool blue tones of the scene, creating a powerful focal point and a sense of immense power being unleashed. The letterbox format enhances the feeling of watching a pivotal moment from an epic film.','社区精选 366','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789444014,'13c50635-ec6a-4252-8b99-e562017b0faf','4a3c6fc8-06ec-4c3f-a7a3-b3bb452fe629');
