A highly detailed illustration of a girl sitting perfectly straight on a chair at a charming outdoor cafe on a bright summer day. She is placed slightly to the right of the center, gracefully holding a cold summer drink with both hands and sipping through a straw. The scene is beautifully framed by lush hanging green leaves at the top and a blue-tinted glass window behind her. The lighting features stunning dappled sunlight filtering through the foliage, creating a relaxed, cozy, and highly cinematic atmosphere with crisp details, vivid textures, and a refreshing summer aesthetic.','社区精选 370','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789444017,'6448e1ad-65a4-40c4-9193-76be02f325c5','4a3c6fc8-06ec-4c3f-a7a3-b3bb452fe629');
