dutch_angle, from_side, from_above, 1girl, solo, waist up, front view, looking up, looking away, tear streak, sitting, barefoot, The character is sitting on a large rock facing the viewer directly, but the framing cuts off just below her waist, so her legs are completely outside the visible frame. She leans back with both hands propped behind her on the rock, tilting her head slightly upward and gazing into the distance beyond the viewer. Her hair is tousled by the strong wind, and a single tear streak glistens on her cheek.
The scene is set on a rocky shoreline at the foot of steep coastal cliffs, with jagged boulders scattered across the beach. Heavy rain pours down as dark thunderclouds press low over the cliffs and the sea. A lone lighthouse stands far in the distance on the cliff edge, unlit, its silhouette barely visible through the downpour. Strong gusts whip up violent waves that crash against the rocks, sending spray into the air., stormy weather, heavy rain, dark clouds, cold colors, desaturated, dramatic lighting, high complexity, detailed background.','社区精选 371','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789444018,'04d4d57e-29bb-4748-8fa5-82e88ce490d0','4a3c6fc8-06ec-4c3f-a7a3-b3bb452fe629');
