The scene is captured with a dramatic cinematic composition, as if the camera dollies across an immense blank scroll. The dragon girl executes a sweeping brushstroke, and the ink droplets burst forward in a spray. As each drop touches the pristine white space, it doesn''t simply splash — it organically grows into a vivid, moving ink wash painting of a Jiangnan water village. (ink transforming into landscape:1.3). Tiny arched bridges, drifting sampans, and misty pavilions emerge from the wet ink in real time, their forms bleeding softly into the surrounding emptiness like a dream taking shape.
Volumetric light enters from the side, casting a gentle golden rim light on the newly born ink landscapes and making the white of the untouched scroll glow ethereally. The girl''s green skin is softly illuminated, her white dress merging with the blank canvas, while her red eyes and red necktie remain the only vivid colors, anchoring the composition. The entire artwork is a breathtaking fusion of living ink magic, traditional Chinese aesthetic philosophy, and high-end anime illustration.
masterpiece, -3::deformed::, very aesthetic, masterpiece','社区精选 381','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789444025,'1cdaf58a-316e-4957-8700-754ce5f8c5ce','4a3c6fc8-06ec-4c3f-a7a3-b3bb452fe629');
