An anime digital illustration depicting a petite vampire catgirl reclining on soft aquamarine bedding. She has a slender build, long disheveled ice-blue hair with wispy bangs spread across white pillows, delicate pointed ears, and soft blue and white feline ears atop her head. Her vibrant crimson eyes sparkle with starry reflections as she looks toward the viewer with a flushed blush and slightly parted lips revealing subtle fangs. Around her neck rests a black ribbon choker adorned with a small golden bell.

The composition utilizes a dynamic low-angle foreshortened perspective, placing intense focus on her bare feet in the foreground to highlight smooth soles and delicate toes. She leans back, using her hands to support her raised thighs. Her attire consists of a frilled white bikini top accented with pastel ribbons and star ornaments, matching low-rise ruffled bikini bottoms, and thin star-embellished bands around her thighs. 

Bright, luminous lighting casts soft glows across her pale skin and hair, complemented by a semi-transparent camera viewfinder overlay featuring framing brackets and a red recording indicator., very aesthetic, masterpiece, no text','社区精选 210','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789444076,'d8948bc4-6f05-4568-a14e-c6288d6806d9','a20d6f18-9712-4212-ac96-adba5aca46ed');
