Two girls standing very close together outdoors during heavy snowfall, recreating the classic “Special Feeling” Japanese TV interview meme. One girl stands on the left, holding an umbrella above both of them and speaking confidently toward an off-screen interviewer with a happy, slightly smug smile. The other girl stands closely beside her on the right, leaning toward her partner and looking extremely embarrassed, blushing heavily while covering most of her face with one hand. They are dressed warmly in winter coats and scarves. Snow is falling around them, with a snowy city street and blurred pedestrians in the background. Medium shot, television street-interview composition, affectionate couple atmosphere, awkwardly romantic and slightly comedic mood.','韩网精选 0165','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789444270,'73a0b7c1-8384-4c01-b85b-4103ebfbb49c','9bf797f5-1b09-4d6f-9f7d-ac1bfad6639e');
