 ```A stunning esoteric black and white woodcut illustration of a mystical girl sitting curled up on a giant crescent moon in a starry space. A giant surreal eye surrounded by wavy optical illusion lines fills the negative space inside the moon''s curve. A striking spiked sunburst halo radiates behind the girl''s head. She is leaning forward, resting her head on her arms on top of a simple U-shaped harp. 1girl, solo, profile, sitting on moon, hugging knees, resting head on arms, barefoot, strappy sandals, draped clothing,1.3::white hair, very long hair, light blue gradient hair, messy hair, blunt bangs::, ahoge, elf ears, x_hair_ornament, ear piercing, short eyebrows, 1.2::bags under eyes, white eyelashes, brown eyes, slit pupils::, looking down, tired, melancholic, 1.4::monochrome, black and white, line art, traditional media, ink, stippling, woodcut, engraving, high contrast::, surrealism, giant eye in background, wavy lines, optical illusion, spiked halo, sunburst, crescent moon, stars, dark sky, esoteric, tarot card```','DC 028','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789444797,'1b3ee819-81c6-4a26-a206-257ff6a51bc7','3cdea03f-db10-40d2-b4a3-c6d3d4621335');
