INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(257746,468,'2girls, furina (genshin impact), mavuika (genshin impact), genshin impact, close comforting embrace, waist-up portrait, three-quarter side view. Furina stands directly in front of the much taller Mavuika, facing into her. {Furina buries her face between Mavuika clothed breasts}, with Furina cheek and forehead softly pressed into the center of Mavuika chest. Furina face remains partly visible in side profile: gently closed eyes, a small peaceful contented smile, lightly pink flushed cheeks, relaxed eyebrows, feeling completely safe. Furina arms wrap loosely around Mavuika waist. Mavuika bends her head slightly toward Furina with a warm maternal expression, tender caring eyes, relaxed eyebrows and a subtle closed-mouth motherly smile. Mavuika right hand gently cups the back and crown of Furina head, fingers resting naturally in her white hair; Mavuika left arm wraps around Furina shoulders and upper back, pulling her close. No arm crosses in front of their faces. Clear height difference and two distinct bodies. Furina has recognizable short white hair with blue accents, small dark blue top hat and exact original blue-and-white Fontaine outfit. Mavuika has recognizable long voluminous red-orange hair with golden ends, golden eyes, exact original black-red-white Natlan outfit with gold ornaments. Mondstadt city plaza behind them with pale stone pavement, fountain, timber-framed buildings, green windmills and cathedral towers under a clear blue sky. Genshin Impact in-game scene, ordinary dialogue-camera framing, 3d, game cg, cel shading, clean anime game models, soft daylight, crisp colorful environment, high complexity, very aesthetic, masterpiece, no text','DC 038','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789444807,'2b76d1a8-ec61-4508-9fdd-3d4db5e238db','3cdea03f-db10-40d2-b4a3-c6d3d4621335');
