INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(257768,468,'{artist:john kafka}, artist:pikuson, artist:fkey, 0.4::artist:ichika (ichika87)::, artist:akaya_shiki, [artist:honnryou_hanaru], [[[artist:onineko]]] ,year 2025, year 2026, artist:iliothermia, [artist:hato_(n_hat_mu)],  2:: loli::, -4:: artist collaboration::

```A slender girl in her mid-teens with long purple hair styled in low twin braids tied with orange ribbons, red eyes, and hair between eyes. She wears a white hooded coat with cross-laced sleeves over a flowing white dress, the coat''s fabric showing soft creases at the elbows and waist. Black gloves cover her hands to mid-forearm. An orange bow sits at her collar and a yellow bow adorns her hair on the left side. The hood is pulled up over her head, framing her face in white fabric. An ethereal outdoor space in diffused daylight, with no distinct foreground objects. She occupies the midground plane against an indeterminate backdrop. Yellow and orange flower petals drift through the air around her, scattered across all depth planes. Light particles float in the space behind her, concentrated toward the right side and fading into soft focus. Green leaves tumble past her left shoulder, closer to the picture plane than the background glow. Cowboy shot at eye level, her body in three-quarter view positioned center-right in the frame. She stands with her torso angled slightly left, holding a single orange flower in both hands at chest height, black-gloved fingers cradling the stem gently. Her right hand supports from below while her left hand steadies from above. Closed mouth, blush across her cheeks, tears visible at the corners of her eyes with more streaming down her face, looking at viewer. Soft even key light from the upper left illuminates her face and the right side of her coat, with gentle rim lighting tracing her left shoulder and hood edge. Clean anime rendering with smooth gradients and delicate line work., atsuko_(blue_archive)```','DC 060','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789444829,'998f85f7-ae00-4a87-bbd3-0e906e354585','3cdea03f-db10-40d2-b4a3-c6d3d4621335');
