INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(257787,468,'{artist:john kafka}, artist:pikuson, artist:fkey, 0.4::artist:ichika (ichika87)::, artist:akaya_shiki, [artist:honnryou_hanaru], [[[artist:onineko]]] ,year 2025, year 2026, artist:iliothermia, [artist:hato_(n_hat_mu)],  2:: loli::, -4:: artist collaboration::


```an oil painting on coarse canvas depicts a giant crescent moon low in the night sky with its entire arc contained within the frame, where the cratered lunar surface pulses with a soft silver edge radiating outward like molten mercury. A tiny kitten perches on the inner curve clutching a slender crystal decanter tilted to spill wine down the dark path like a ribbon scattering gold dust and multicolored sparks into the void. Far below, a twenty-five-year-old woman stands upon a mirror-like black ocean wearing a flowing black dress, her face illuminated from beneath as she gazes upward with a gentle smile while raising a large crystal wine glass high overhead to catch the crimson stream glowing with a molten core that lights up dust floating around her. Rainbow-hued smoke curls around the moon carrying shimmering particles through the cold sky, cut diagonally by a strip of purple-edged light binding the kitten and woman together while outlining its fur in warm gold against strong 35mm film grain and cinematic vertical composition where pigment bloom catches on the glass and canvas tooth shows through thin passages.```','DC 079','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789444848,'0cbb3e9e-0aff-492a-8b95-fd81a9e739fa','3cdea03f-db10-40d2-b4a3-c6d3d4621335');
