</style>, A_slender_girl_in_her_mid-teens_with_long_purple_hair_styled_in_low_twin_braids_tied_with_orange_ribbons, red_eyes, and_hair_between_eyes._She_wears_a_white_hooded_coat_with_cross-laced_sleeves_over_a_flowing_white_dress, the_coat''s_fabric_showing_soft_creases_at_the_elbows_and_waist._Black_gloves_cover_her_hands_to_mid-forearm._An_orange_bow_sits_at_her_collar_and_a_yellow_bow_adorns_her_hair_on_the_left_side._The_hood_is_pulled_up_over_her_head, framing_her_face_in_white_fabric._An_ethereal_outdoor_space_in_diffused_daylight, with_no_distinct_foreground_objects._She_occupies_the_midground_plane_against_an_indeterminate_backdrop._Yellow_and_orange_flower_petals_drift_through_the_air_around_her, scattered_across_all_depth_planes._Light_particles_float_in_the_space_behind_her, concentrated_toward_the_right_side_and_fading_into_soft_focus._Green_leaves_tumble_past_her_left_shoulder, closer_to_the_picture_plane_than_the_background_glow._Cowboy_shot_at_eye_level, her_body_in_three-quarter_view_positioned_center-right_in_the_frame._She_stands_with_her_torso_angled_slightly_left, holding_a_single_orange_flower_in_both_hands_at_chest_height, black-gloved_fingers_cradling_the_stem_gently._Her_right_hand_supports_from_below_while_her_left_hand_steadies_from_above._Closed_mouth, blush_across_her_cheeks, tears_visible_at_the_corners_of_her_eyes_with_more_streaming_down_her_face, looking_at_viewer._Soft_even_key_light_from_the_upper_left_illuminates_her_face_and_the_right_side_of_her_coat, with_gentle_rim_lighting_tracing_her_left_shoulder_and_hood_edge._Clean_anime_rendering_with_smooth_gradients_and_delicate_line_work., atsuko_(blue_archive), very aesthetic, masterpiece, no text','DC 101','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789444870,'74616831-a824-412e-ae6d-4be815d8f48a','3cdea03f-db10-40d2-b4a3-c6d3d4621335');
