year 2025, year 2026, loli, young, baby face, soft face, cute face, round face, plump cheeks, soft cheeks, large watery eyes, shiny eyes, teary eyes, small nose, small mouth, soft lineart, 1.2::impasto::, 1.05::oil painting (medium)::, painterly, soft shading, 1.4::soft skin::, 1.3::smooth skin::, 1.25::glossy skin::, 1.2::shiny skin::, oily skin, delicate skin, porcelain skin, plump skin, soft lighting, subsurface scattering, volumetric lighting, rim light, depth of field, strong shading, bright lighting, glowing light, light particles, detailed fabric, anime coloring, very aesthetic, best quality, ultra-detailed, spot_color, limited_palette, A_very_aesthetic_and_high-quality_anime-style_illustration_featuring_a_solo_petite_girl_sitting_gracefully_in_a_mystical_body_of_water._She_has_a_smug_smile_on_her_face, exuding_confidence._Her_most_striking_features_are_her_blue_eyes_framed_by_glasses_and_her_magnificent_hair_style._She_has_\(low_twin_tails\) with_\(hair_ribbons_tied_below_the_front_of_the_chest\)._Specifically, she_possesses_\(\(\(Waist-length_dark_blue_hair_gathered_into_two_ponytails_positioned_over_the_front_of_the_chest\)\)\), adorned_with_symmetrical_red_bows_on_both_sides_of_the_head._The_hair_is_silky_and_flowing, naturally_cascading_down_to_the_waist, rendered_as_glossy_hair_strands_with_texture_that_are_gently_flowing_around_her._She_wears_a_complex_outfit_consisting_of_a_white_open_cropped_jacket_with_wide_detached_sleeves_lined_in_purple, revealing_her_small_breasts_and_midriff, paired_with_tight_black_shorts._She_is_barefoot, her_pale_legs_submerged_in_the_swirling_blue_water, creating_gentle_splashes_and_ripples._She_holds_a_traditional_red_paper_umbrella_\(wagasa\) in_her_hand, resting_the_handle_against_her_shoulder._The_background_is_a_dark, surreal_fantasy_enironment_featuring_giant, white_skeletal_ribs_curving_overhead, suggesting_sitting_within_a_massive_beast_or_magical_construct._The_scene_is_populated_by_vibrant_Red_Spider_Lilies_\(Lycoris_radiata\) floating_in_the_water_and_air, their_red_petals_contrasting_beautifully_against_the_cool_blue_tones_of_the_water_and_her_hair._The_lighting_is_dramatic, with_a_reddish_hue_reflecting_from_the_background_onto_the_water, while_soft, cool_light_highlights_her_skin_and_the_texture_of_her_clothing, very aesthetic, masterpiece, no text','DC 104','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789444873,'6f4292ba-0e6a-44da-8728-cb0fd13872c0','3cdea03f-db10-40d2-b4a3-c6d3d4621335');
