t, she_wears_traditional_white_tabi_socks_and_sandals, her_legs_casually_crossed_in_a_relaxed_posture._One_of_her_hands_is_raised_delicately_near_her_head, fingers_gently_holding_a_single_stem_of_a_red_spider_lily, connecting_her_directly_to_the_environment._The_lighting_is_ethereal_and_cinematic, casting_soft_shadows_that_accentuate_the_folds_of_her_clothing_and_the_texture_of_the_flower_petals_floating_in_the_air, creating_a_mysterious, romantic, and_highly_aesthetic_atmosphere, BREAK, petite_girl, 1girl(smooth_white_long_hair, long_wavy_hair, hair_styled_in_a_loose, (red_tips), detailed_hair_strands, (red_streaked_hair), (red_gradient_hair), bishoujo, amber_eyes), small_breasts, solo_focus, delicate_facial_features, smile, blush, very aesthetic, masterpiece, no text','DC 206','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789444975,'99764b53-581c-4f32-ac5f-0dda4bcb3349','3cdea03f-db10-40d2-b4a3-c6d3d4621335');
