.Anime-style_young_girl_with_messy, layered_hair_flowing_naturally_in_motion._She_has_large, bright_eyes_filled_with_confidence_and_the_joy_of_sports, with_a_slight_smile._Her_sleeves_billow_in_the_wind, revealing_energetic_body_lines._The_girl_is_captured_in_a_high-difficulty_moment_of_a_skateboard_jump, her_body_in_a_highly_tense_and_dynamic_mid-air_pose._Her_right_leg_is_tucked_deeply_toward_her_chest, her_left_leg_extends_downward_to_press_on_the_center_of_the_skateboard, her_right_hand_is_raised_forward_to_the_side_for_balance_with_fingers_naturally_spread, and_her_left_hand_swings_backward_and_downward_with_inertia._The_skateboard_beneath_her_features_a_light_blue_deck_with_black_trucks_and_wheels._The_background_is_a_clean, bright_outdoor_sports_field, with_sunlight_shining_from_diagonally_above, casting_soft, grainy_shadows_on_the_ground._The_overall_art_style_uses_clean_cel-shading_with_smooth, sharp_lines_and_bright, fresh_colors._The_light_and_shadow_treatment_is_delicate, with_distinct_terminators_on_the_girl''s_skin_and_clothing_folds, conveying_a_strong_sense_of_space_and_three-dimensionality._The_composition_uses_a_low-angle_shot_to_enhance_the_height_of_the_jump_and_visual_impact, featuring_extreme_clarity, rich_textures, and_a_high-quality_anime_illustration_aesthetic.','DC 208','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789444977,'513f9d8f-3150-434a-8667-4b9f878be47f','3cdea03f-db10-40d2-b4a3-c6d3d4621335');
