INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(258365,191,'koharu (blue archive), 
-1.5::monocrome, flat color, simple background, retro artstyle::,  masterpiece, best quality, very aesthetic, absurdres, 

## Panel 1 (Top large panel)
- Main girl with long dark hair, leaning forward with a fierce, intense expression. Her face is heavily blushed, eyes narrowed in anger/determination, eyebrows furrowed.
- Large sound effect: "두둥!" (a snorting/huffing sound)
- Huge bold text on the left: "100번 가버리기!?"
- Speech bubble (right): "불평해도 어쩔 수 없다는걸 알고는 있지만..."
- Speech bubble (below): "어차피 안하면 못나가니까 하겠지만!"
- Small reaction from the left: "아아..."
- Bottom speech bubble: "여기서 나가면 무조건 저 이상한 설정 만든사람을 전부 패버릴거예요!!!!"

## Panel 2 (Left middle)
- Small chibi version of the same girl with a worried sweat drop on her head, muttering: "음..."
- A person in the background asks: "하하 그런데 ''손에러브'' 라는 정의는 어떻게 하는거야?"
- The chibi girl answers with a puzzled expression: "무슨 소리에요?"

## Panel 3 (Right middle)
- A man with short hair and a muscular, blushing shyly, looking downward.
- his speech bubble: "이야 ㅇㅇ한테 비교적 현실적인 횟수라고 생각하는데?"
- The main girl (upper right, partially shown) responds with a cold, sharp expression: "ㅇㅇ은 정말로 나를 진짜로 많이 사랑해?"

## Panel 4 (Bottom left)
- Another chibi version of the main girl, completely wide-eyed and shocked, blushing intensely, staring blankly.
- A voice from off-panel says: "아"
- Another voice asks: "왜?"


## Panel 5 (Bottom center/right)
- The main girl sitting on a desk with her legs crossed, wearing a school uniform with a vest. She has a shy and blush, as if teasing.
- Huge speech bubble from her: "오빠처럼 여자아이를 오나홀 취급하는 최저의 성범죄자라도 할수있는 범위에서 최대한 하는거죠...", very aesthetic, masterpiece, no text, teXt: 두둥!

100번 가버리기!?

불평해도 어쩔 수 없다는걸 알고는 있지만...

어차피 안하면 못나가니까 하겠지만!

아아...

여기서 나가면 무조건 저 이상한 설정 만든사람을 전부 패버릴거예요!!!!

음...

하하 그런데 ''손에러브'' 라는 정의는 어떻게 하는거야?

무슨 소리에요?

이야 ㅇㅇ한테 비교적 현실적인 횟수라고 생각하는데?

ㅇㅇ은 정말로 나를 진짜로 많이 사랑해?

