Create a comic divided into two panels, left and right.
Left panel:
Neptune is embraced head-on by a vampire on a night street and bitten on the neck. The vampire presses its mouth tightly against Neptune’s neck, and its fangs sink into Neptune’s delicate skin. A small amount of blood trickles from the bite wound, and Neptune screams.
Right panel: 
From a top-down view, Neptune’s body lies face-up, unconscious with her eyes closed. Two small puncture wounds, arranged in a vertical line, mark the vampire’s bite on her neck. A small amount of blood trickles from the wounds. Neptune’s expression as she lies there is peaceful.



