INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(261634,106,'The image features girl centered in the frame from the mid-thigh up,set against a background of white clouds in a light sky. girl is a girl with short white hair,blunt bangs,and bright blue eyes. She has pink blush on her cheeks and a small tan bandage on her left cheek. She is wearing a thick white hood with large,rounded bear ears,and a brown bear-faced sleep mask rests on her forehead. Two dark,star-shaped clips pin her hair on the right side. She is dressed in a light cream,off-the-shoulder top with a white ruffled neckline,exposing her upper chest and shoulders. The garment is decorated with a large brown bear face print on the center and smaller bear heads and clouds across the fabric,gathered by a dark brown ribbon near the waist. Her right arm hangs downward while her left hand is raised near her shoulder,and she has an open-mouthed smile. Surrounding girl are several small,brown teddy bears floating in the air. One bear on the top right wears a blue nightcap with white stars,while others on the left and right wear small blue bow ties. Thin,bright blue ribbons swirl through the air around girl and the bears.','原版自然语言','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789448695,'68122ce3-129e-4b0f-9c8b-02f02de03de4','78b87bcf-5009-4ba8-af4b-7c7b37f147ee');
