INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(265291,72,'1girl,solo,1.6::spinning in a midnight flamenco studio,a red dress swirling like living fire,her body a sharp silhouette against the dark,emotionally charged space::,1.5::a dramatic,arresting pose,head thrown back with a rose stem between her teeth,one leg extended through the dress''s high slit,sweat tracing the choreographic marks drawn on her skin in lipstick::,1.5::a vibrant red flamenco dress,torn open along the side to reveal her entire leg,fabric and skin slick with sweat,glowing under the stark rehearsal lights::,1.4::a drop of blood from the rose thorn mixes with falling petals,caught in a partner''s hand pressed against the small of her back,the heat and moisture translating through the thin fabric::,1.3::textures of fierce silk,damp skin,velvety petals,sharp thorns,and the firm touch of a hand::,1.2::background of a bare,atmospheric dance studio with wooden floors and mirrored walls reflecting the intense,solitary performance::,masterpiece,flamenco catharsis,a portrait where pain,beauty,and touch converge in a dance that bleeds beyond the skin.','玫瑰刺舞者','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789452352,'457ee6be-15a9-4e43-9ae3-dd7c8a88385b','56e1fca3-2ac6-4fa7-abf4-69603eda55db');
INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(265292,72,'1girl,solo,1.6::reclining in the shadows of a ruined nile temple at night,illuminated by moonlight and the faint glow of ancient pigments on the walls::,1.5::a relaxed,regal pose,one hand adjusting an elaborate wig as a strap of her ceremonial armor slips from her shoulder,revealing her back fully to the cool night air::,1.5::a golden chestplate secured by crossed scarab-embossed straps,leaving a diamond-shaped opening above her left breast where skin dusted with powdered lapis lazuli is visible,hieratic script painted in ochre along her spine::,1.4::moonlight catches the metallic gleam of the armor and the subtle shimmer of the pigments on her skin,while the ancient paint of the eye of horus watches from behind::,1.3::textures of polished gold,powdered mineral skin,rough stone walls,woven wig fibers,and dry desert air::,1.2::background of crumbling temple columns and fragmented murals under a star-filled desert sky,steeped in silence and history::,masterpiece,pharaonic intimacy,a portrait where divine adornment and mortal inscription merge under the moon''s timeless gaze.','埃及遗迹','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789452353,'e24194ad-0dd0-4e7f-80ef-6ec9bba08f68','56e1fca3-2ac6-4fa7-abf4-69603eda55db');
