INSERT INTO "tag_tags" VALUES(265652,73,'This image shows a cheerful and vibrant young girl standing outdoors,enjoying the beauty of autumn. The warm sunlight bathes her in a soft,golden glow,complementing the vibrant orange,yellow,and red leaves scattered in the background. She playfully holds a bright red maple leaf up to her face,covering one eye with it as she smiles brightly. Her outfit consists of a cozy,light blue cardigan and a neutral-colored turtleneck.
The atmosphere is full of lighthearted joy and a sense of fun as she engages with the natural surroundings. The falling leaves add to the sense of movement,as if they are dancing in the breeze alongside her. Her expression exudes warmth and happiness,creating an inviting and heartwarming feeling,as though she''s sharing this peaceful moment of autumn with the viewer.outdoors,day,blurry foreground,foreground,-1::building::,colorful,dappled sunlight,sunlight,light rays,yellow theme,photographic reference,depth of field,photo background,3::cinematic angle,cinematic lighting::,lens flare,','一叶知秋','rgba(255, 123, 2, .4)',1789452713,'5991031c-596d-4927-b52c-e1d6bf2e7038','4cd4a244-9e15-48b2-8f10-85d18634105d');
